The  RootOK  authentication service module for PAM provides func‐
tionality for only one PAM category: authentication.  In terms of
the parameter, this is the feature.   It  also  provides  a  null
function  for session management.  The RootOK authentication com‐
ponent always returns success for the superuser; i.e., if returns
0.  The following options may be  passed  to  the  authentication
module:  debugging  information  at level.  suppress warning mes‐
sages to the user.  These messages include reasons why the user’s
authentication attempt was declined.
